er-spacing:\r\n-.05pt'> <\/span>contain<span style='letter-spacing:-.05pt'> <\/span>silica which\r\nis lupus sensitive<span style='letter-spacing:-.05pt'> <\/span>APTT. This APTT\r\nshould not be used for factor deficiency<span style='letter-spacing:-.05pt'> <\/span>diagnosis\r\n(preoperative<span style='letter-spacing:-.05pt'> <\/span>or bleeding<span\r\nstyle='letter-spacing:-.05pt'> <\/span>disorder).<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:2.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:7.5pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:\r\n7.5pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>- Prolonged<span style='letter-spacing:\r\n-.05pt'> <\/span>LA senstive<span style='letter-spacing:-.05pt'> <\/span>APTT\r\nseen with Lupus anticoagulant,<span style='letter-spacing:-.05pt'> <\/span>dysfibrinogenemia,<span\r\nstyle='letter-spacing:-.05pt'> <\/span>presence<span style='letter-spacing:-.05pt'>\r\n<\/span>of heparin,<span style='letter-spacing:-.05pt'> <\/span>intrinsic<span\r\nstyle='letter-spacing:-.05pt'> <\/span>factor deficiencies<span\r\nstyle='letter-spacing:-.05pt'> <\/span>or presence<span style='letter-spacing:\r\n-.05pt'> <\/span>of factor inhibitors.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:.05pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:7.5pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:\r\n7.5pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>- It is preferable that sample to\r\nbe obtained prior to or in the absence of anticoagulant therapy as this may\r\ninterfere<span style='letter-spacing:1.7pt'> <\/span>with the assay or a\r\nsufficient period after its discontinuation.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:2.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:7.5pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:\r\n7.5pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>- Inconclusive<span\r\nstyle='letter-spacing:-.05pt'> <\/span>results needs to be tested